.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Display more verbose output.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Minimize program output. Only errors and warnings are
displayed.
.TP
\fB\-\-trace\fR
Enable verbose function tracing.
.TP
\fB\-\-logconfig\fR=\fI\,LOGCONFIG\/\fR
Specify alternate config log.
.TP
\fB\-\-security\-key\fR=\fI\,SECURITY_KEY\/\fR
BIOS pre\-calculated security key.
.TP
\fB\-\-password\fR=\fI\,PASSWORD\/\fR
BIOS Setup password for set/activate operations.
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-rawpassword\fR
Do not auto\-convert password to scancodes.
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-dat\fR=\fI\,MEMORY_DAT\/\fR
Path to a memory dump file to use instead of real RAM
.TP
\fB\-\-cmos\-dat\fR=\fI\,CMOS_DAT\/\fR
Path to a CMOS dump file to use instead of real CMOS
.TP
\fB\-\-value\fR=\fI\,VALUE\/\fR
Set new value
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-battery\fR
Set new value to be used while running on battery
